---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About" description="About Pints & Payloads.">
  <section class="page wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">ABOUT</div>
    <h1>A cyber security blog<br /><em>without the conference voice.</em></h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Pints & Payloads is a home for security ramblings: red teaming, penetration testing, social engineering, physical security, cloud, Active Directory and the odd rabbit hole that starts with “I wonder if…”</p>
      <p>The aim is simple: write about security like people actually talk about it. Practical, opinionated and understandable.</p>
      <blockquote>“The best security lesson is usually the one you can explain to someone over a pint.”</blockquote>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>